      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T23:30:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm I can get the config enabled in kconfig-ro.conf but don\u0027t see it being used to actually include the header into the build. Uploading with what I have, maybe you can point me to what I\u0027m doing wrong.\n\nAlso quick question: Is there much of a point to adding this to zmake? We use twister to run/build all tests now. I suppose folks could flash it on a device, but wouldn\u0027t the image be too large with essentially zero optimization?",
