      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T23:51:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Got it, yeah, that should probably be plumbed thru twister instead.\n\nAnother alternative is to just generate the header from twister and add the `-include` to `EXTRA_CFLAGS`. Up to you.\n\nI think it\u0027s better than having people comment out an option in the cmake, which leaves them with a dirty git state.",
