      "writtenOn": "2022-09-13T15:05:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I tried:\n`\u0027./twister --clobber -i -s zephyr/test/drivers/drivers.default -b -x EXTRA_CFLAGS\u003d-DCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_DEBUG_SYMBOLS\u0027`\n\nI\u0027ve confirmed this does add the `-DCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_DEBUG_SYMBOLS` but it still doesn\u0027t work. I think this is because the CMake stuff gets evaluated *before* the `-DCONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_DEBUG_SYMBOLS` is added. Hence the new ifdef CMake flags code won\u0027t evaluate to adding the flags when we need it to.\n\nI think just the enabling/disabling of the option in the prj.conf is how we should do this for now. It does leave with a dirty git, but only a single line.\n\nThere should be a feature for this in twister though, I can make that bug if you think it\u0027s valuable enough.",
      "parentUuid": "826a303e_fb7cc909",
